    {
      "bbox": [
        371,
        1724,
        1767,
        2072
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "You are cordially invited to attend and participate. If you desire to do so, please notify Mr. Samuel Mandell, Law Department, Room 1721, Municipal Building, New York City, 10007; telephone - 566-5876; also please send him the names of the authorized delegates from your Department indicating the organizations that they represent, no later than February 15, 1967.",
